WEBVTT

46:30.689 --> 46:31.940
(BARKS)

46:34.485 --> 46:37.863
My prince, my poor prince,
look what they did to you.

46:37.988 --> 46:40.366
Stay here. I'll go back to the inn
and bring help.

46:40.491 --> 46:41.658
Then go!

46:43.577 --> 46:45.788
Don't touch me.

46:46.330 --> 46:47.831
(RUSTLING, FOOTSTEPS)

46:47.956 --> 46:50.876
MAN: The wolf's not here.
Look down by the stream.

46:53.128 --> 46:55.464
(NYMERIA WHINES)

46:57.007 --> 47:00.844
You've got to go. They'll kill you
for what you did to Joffrey.
